    metaDesc: "Managed print solutions without lock-in contracts. Business printers, copiers & MFDs with transparent pricing. No hidden costs. Fresh Tech, Shropshire.",
    description: "The managed print industry is full of leasing traps: 5-year contracts, inflated click charges, automatic renewals, and exit penalties that cost more than a new printer. We work with a specialist print partner who does things properly. They provide **direct manufacturer warranty and service** with **national coverage**, matching the right printer to the job with no brand loyalty. If a managed print service doesn't make financial sense for your business, they'll tell you honestly rather than signing you up anyway. Read our [Ultimate Guide to Managed Print](/managed-print-guide) for the full picture.",
