    solution: "Through our print partner, we source business-grade printers that you own outright, backed by direct manufacturer warranty and a proper service contract. The right machine for the job, not whatever earns the highest commission. Our free print audit monitors your actual usage for 30 days, then we present the facts. If the numbers don't stack up for managed print, we'll say so.",
