        localContext: "We support businesses across all of Shrewsbury - from professional services firms overlooking the Severn to manufacturers at Battlefield Enterprise Park, from retailers in the Darwin Centre to educational organisations around the College cluster. We understand the specific challenges of working in a medieval town centre with listed buildings and modern connectivity needs.",
