            { q: "Do you support businesses at Battlefield Enterprise Park?", a: "Yes - we support several businesses across Battlefield and the surrounding business parks. We understand the connectivity setup there and can arrange an onsite visit, billed separately, when remote resolution is not possible." },
            { q: "What does IT support in Shrewsbury typically cost?", a: "Our managed IT support starts from around £30 per user per month, which includes unlimited remote helpdesk, 24/7 monitoring and security tools. Onsite visits are billed separately. We publish our [pricing](/pricing) openly - no hidden costs, no surprises. We'll give you a fixed quote based on your team size and requirements." },
            { q: "Can you help us move from our current IT provider?", a: "Absolutely. We handle the entire transition - documenting your existing setup, migrating accounts, and ensuring zero downtime during the switch. We've onboarded dozens of businesses from other providers and have a structured [onboarding process](/onboarding) that makes it painless." },
            { q: "Do you provide IT support for Shrewsbury businesses with remote workers?", a: "Yes - hybrid and remote working is a core part of what we support. We use [Microsoft 365](/services/microsoft-365-business) with Intune device management to ensure your team's laptops are secured and managed wherever they're working - whether that's the office, home, or a Shrewsbury coffee shop." }
