        localContext: "We support businesses across Worcester - from professional services in the city centre to enterprises at Worcester Six Business Park, from the Shrub Hill Quarter to growing companies around the university. Worcester's position as a commercial hub means businesses here expect high standards - and that's exactly what we deliver.",
