            { q: "We have poor broadband in rural Herefordshire - will Microsoft 365 work?", a: "Yes - we configure Microsoft 365 with offline access for desktop apps, optimise Teams settings for lower-bandwidth connections, and can recommend connectivity solutions including [Starlink and 4G](/services/managed-it-support) for businesses with persistent broadband challenges." },
            { q: "How much could we save on Microsoft 365 licences?", a: "Most businesses we audit are either on the wrong tier or have unused licences. We typically save 15-25% through proper licence allocation. We'll provide specific recommendations after reviewing your current setup." },
            { q: "Do you provide training for our Hereford team?", a: "Yes - practical, hands-on training tailored to your workflows. Not generic tutorials, but guidance on how your specific team can use Teams, SharePoint, and other tools more effectively. Delivered remotely or, where it makes sense, in person as separately billed work." },
            { q: "Can you help us replace our file server with SharePoint?", a: "Absolutely. We design SharePoint document libraries that replicate your current folder structure (or improve it), migrate your files, and train your team. Properly configured SharePoint eliminates the need for on-premises file servers and makes files accessible from anywhere." }
